      <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Firma trasera</span><span class="spec-val">Bordado hilo blanco · Panel posterior</span></div>
      <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Cierre</span><span class="spec-val">Snapback acero inoxidable · 5 posiciones</span></div>
